  "description": "The Core (Business Logic Layer) for WEB6 - the AI abstraction layer of the OASIS Omniverse. Provides a unified interface across AI providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Ollama and more), hosts the OASIS MCP Server integration, and enables AI-augmented avatar interactions, quest generation and holonic reasoning.",
